{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-1865bd801425ecda9adb","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"어때, 레코드판은 입수했어?","speaker":"폼폼","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["2144012748168039010"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1479042896318927324","4179659318032534198","10998843618276587336","4784173386511257180","12251887674083409623","14202545754803932663","7666657101691150224","5282338905933604877","4768973592244708","3917807579265079760","2722297317573713960","7756966884920887303","5528974360778491236","12033131492051639831","8390327503616493981"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7486-626949e19b0320cbf09c","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"(폼폼에게 레코드판에 대해 알려준다)","speaker":"","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["15964188637333975910"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7486-598af7b65f017434aee5","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"서벌 씨한테 부탁해 봤는데 지금은 레코드판이 없다네","speaker":"","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"narration","textHashCandidates":["15006228300693850816"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":true},{"id":"other-message-p7486-91f00c231dacd559e10a","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"그렇구나. 그럼 내가 「컴퍼니」에 가서 주문할 수 있는지 물어볼게. 하지만 내가 아무리 열차 차장이라도 모든 승객의 취향에 맞출 순 없을 거야","speaker":"폼폼","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8797806420277943462"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1479042896318927324","4179659318032534198","10998843618276587336","4784173386511257180","12251887674083409623","14202545754803932663","7666657101691150224","5282338905933604877","4768973592244708","3917807579265079760","2722297317573713960","7756966884920887303","5528974360778491236","12033131492051639831","8390327503616493981"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7486-e85e231edbd6e260dd2d","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"그렇다고 실망하진 마. 넌 개척자니 바깥을 돌아다니다 보면 언제든 기회가 생기겠지","speaker":"폼폼","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["17470459280895496995"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1479042896318927324","4179659318032534198","10998843618276587336","4784173386511257180","12251887674083409623","14202545754803932663","7666657101691150224","5282338905933604877","4768973592244708","3917807579265079760","2722297317573713960","7756966884920887303","5528974360778491236","12033131492051639831","8390327503616493981"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-message-p7486-2b7f358a7b066cce2477","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"sef203aad074947e0","text":"축음기도 열차에 있잖아. 어디 도망 안 간다고","speaker":"폼폼","mission":"폼폼","scene":"메시지 5","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5923164962813692381"],"speakerHashCandidates":["1479042896318927324","4179659318032534198","10998843618276587336","4784173386511257180","12251887674083409623","14202545754803932663","7666657101691150224","5282338905933604877","4768973592244708","3917807579265079760","2722297317573713960","7756966884920887303","5528974360778491236","12033131492051639831","8390327503616493981"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"message-p7486","title":"폼폼","page":"短信/星穹列车/帕姆","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-1865bd801425ecda9adb","rowId":"other-message-p7486-1865bd801425ecda9adb","missionId":"message-p7486","mission":"폼폼","sceneId":"sef203aad074947e0","scene":"메시지 5","contextId":"wiki-context-4b125414da3d165851e24572","page":"短信/星穹列车/帕姆","revision":71002,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":["other-message-p7486-626949e19b0320cbf09c"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-message